            "detailed_description": "Ok this is pretty geeky and may not be for all but we think it`s cool, the first VR bitcoin block explorer!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEver wanted to see real time bitcoin transaction in VR? Ever wanted to prune the blockchain with a bow and arrow? Enter the forest of satoshi!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Bitcoin VR you can see real time bitcoin transactions fall from the sky in the form of gems you can grab a gem to see the transaction details or shoot them with a Bow and Arrow.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Aspects:<br />\r\nThe larger the transaction size the larger the gem!<br />\r\nBlock confirmation effects!<br />\r\nView counterparty token transactions!<br />\r\nArchery and mini game!",
